# error-prefix-block-indent-mismatch

## Input

```
a.
    x 1
  y 2

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..17
  PREFIX_BLOCK@0..11
    WORD_KEY@0..2
      WORD@0..2 "a."
    NEWLINE@2..3 "\n"
    SPACE@3..7 "    "
    ENTRY@7..11
      WORD_KEY@7..8
        WORD@7..8 "x"
      SPACE@8..9 " "
      INTEGER@9..10
        NUMERAL@9..10 "1"
      NEWLINE@10..11 "\n"
  SPACE@11..13 "  "
  ENTRY@13..17
    WORD_KEY@13..14
      WORD@13..14 "y"
    SPACE@14..15 " "
    INTEGER@15..16
      NUMERAL@15..16 "2"
    NEWLINE@16..17 "\n"
```

## Syntax Error

```
[
    SyntaxError {
        message: "indentation does not match any enclosing block",
        range: 11..13,
    },
]
```

## AST

```
SourceFile {
    items: [
        PrefixBlock {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@0..2 "a.",
            },
            items: [
                Entry {
                    key: WordKey {
                        word: WORD@7..8 "x",
                    },
                    value: Integer {
                        sign: none,
                        numeral: NUMERAL@9..10 "1",
                    },
                },
            ],
        },
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@13..14 "y",
            },
            value: Integer {
                sign: none,
                numeral: NUMERAL@15..16 "2",
            },
        },
    ],
}
```

